<!-- Rootz app mark: the SU superhero robot (brand canon — Android green
     #3DDC84, red cape, yellow SU diamond) on the dark brand tile. Vector
     port of apps/web/public/icon.svg. The SVG's "SU" lettering is omitted:
     VectorDrawable has no <text> element and the glyph is ~3px at icon
     size. -->
